    "decision": "admit_bounded_astrology_v1_with_typed_evidence_pipeline",
    "rationale": "Astrology Production v1 retains the existing natal/transit/place-resolution calculation path, runtime gates, exact-reference pipeline, interpretation handoff and output guard. It additionally admits a composition-only typed pipeline that inserts the bounded deterministic evidence selector between the admitted reading run and the existing handoff. The typed pipeline preserves explicit selection provenance and legacy exact-reference compatibility, while granting no free-text NLU, astrological-meaning, source-admission, final-prose, scientific-validity, or storage authority. The REFERENCE-ONLY query-resolution research stack remains non-production.",
